        "TileImage": "$($repository bcdb769b-b7a4-4342-98c8-7d8c5224930d).Image",
        "Description": "At Hokkaido&apos;s exclusive GAMA facility, Dr. Takemi Shiraishi and Dr. Yukio Matsushima are running a lethal black-market organ ring under the guise of medical complications. Guarding this highly lucrative operation is Akihide Nishihara, an elite security chief who ensures snooping patients or staff permanently disappear. ICA management wants this malpractice terminated. Eliminate the corrupt doctors, neutralize their enforcer, and ensure no more &quot;accidents&quot; happen on the operating table. Good luck",
